	(text "1. Sensor connector and calibration review" (at 15.24 39.022 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0d3e4fc3-25fb-5334-91e3-5b8a33983d9d"))
	(text "Actual ${de5971d3-210a-427e-bcf2-1b0120408c65:REFERENCE} pinout: 1 SIG_N (white), 2 SIG_P (green), 3 VEXC (red), 4 GND (black), 5 shield. ${40e56e35-9be9-4a08-b34c-74e61a20dedd:REFERENCE} is the fitted 0 ohm shield tie. ${80f29761-f104-4294-a3b6-6bdaf34c95b7:REFERENCE}/${799e2d6a-2867-4a33-b918-63008ea07cdb:REFERENCE} are intended to" (at 15.24 43.172 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8d1012ae-8410-51d2-876f-20ae7ef6d007"))
	(text "shunt a bridge arm for calibration. CRITICAL REVIEW: ${799e2d6a-2867-4a33-b918-63008ea07cdb:REFERENCE} source is SIG_N, about 5 V. A ground-referenced 3.3 V gate gives Vgs about -1.7 V, so it cannot enable this" (at 15.24 45.712 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6cfb4b55-f759-55ab-94a9-97d77efac7f7"))
	(text "N-channel FET as documented. No gate pull-down exists in this netlist." (at 15.24 48.252 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d58ae4db-ba26-51c2-b539-852cecb6f35a"))
