	(text "PLACE: Put ${56734356-0950-460b-8e64-9afcc40e7fc4:REFERENCE} at AVDD and ${05d9f0df-8574-4562-a24d-659d20d8726e:REFERENCE}/${48265aa8-957e-4cb1-ab43-5e5cfbf59651:REFERENCE} at DVDD. Put ${c36718c6-2625-4ecb-9d09-e6c8ca5f87b1:REFERENCE} at REFIO; ${df26c127-44b7-4149-b328-e21dbb7ec93e:REFERENCE}/${f5c93b6f-1aa2-4fd7-b5e8-57c5ab0523a4:REFERENCE} at REFCAP, with ${f5c93b6f-1aa2-4fd7-b5e8-57c5ab0523a4:REFERENCE} nearest the pin." (at 15.24 511.224592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9d4a5f99-b06e-5fd8-af16-2d9b0c02f802"))
	(text "ROUTE: Use short reference-capacitor return loops and a continuous low-impedance local ground. Keep serial edges away from ADC_IN and both reference nodes." (at 15.24 515.034592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b6a132db-4608-5df3-91e1-89bad280964f"))
