	(polyline (pts (xy 670.76 232.41) (xy 825.76 232.41)) (stroke (width 0.254) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "88bcef84-a53b-5e3c-a5e2-a19dcdf005b9"))
	(text "OPERATION" (at 670.76 234.95 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7bb09e55-f2d6-5607-ab67-9a4832b849ef"))
	(text "Signal path: SIG_P/SIG_N -> IN_P/IN_N -> INA_OUT -> ATT_TAP -> FILT_IN -> AMP_VOUT. ADC_IN reads full amplitude; TQ_AOUT and TQ_AOUT_MON" (at 670.76 239.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c62507fe-748e-576c-a82e-ce56599a1114"))
	(text "read half amplitude." (at 670.76 241.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3a02cc82-b002-5dd3-bb63-5d2d2b7cf33a"))
	(text "Ideal DC: INA_OUT = VEXC/2 + 191.734 x (SIG_P - SIG_N); AMP_VOUT = INA_OUT/3; unloaded TQ_AOUT = AMP_VOUT/2." (at 670.76 245.45 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7885a216-0d5e-5069-af12-cfcd86433518"))
	(text "At 10 V excitation, zero torque is 1.6667 V at AMP_VOUT and 0.8333 V at TQ_AOUT. Nominal +/-1.5 mV/V rated bridge output gives 0.3540-1.3127 V" (at 670.76 249.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ec337237-b2f5-55bd-8c2d-80aa82bec9b4"))
	(text "at TQ_AOUT." (at 670.76 251.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6c0887cf-3b4a-5a67-aa62-6183f33b1ee0"))
	(text "With the 1.577 mV/V sensor certificate, ideal +/-150% overload gives 0.0774-1.5892 V at TQ_AOUT. These are calculated values before tolerances" (at 670.76 255.61 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5fb6982c-e420-5d7d-a0e4-79656e14e426"))
	(text "and loading." (at 670.76 258.15 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "52502199-a234-52ee-987b-99bc0c3b1243"))
	(text "Configure ADS8689 for 0-5.12 V; allow 20 ms for its reference, then allow bridge thermal settling. Fit ADC and analog-output calibration separately" (at 670.76 261.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "826f2161-684f-574b-b5b1-08e3118f93e3"))
	(text "for each sensor / board / cable; tare before trials." (at 670.76 264.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "74ab9284-8bd1-5dd7-837c-20bd609cc0c3"))
	(text "The 1.642 V level is the documented upstream INA-limited ceiling, not a universal fault clamp. A buffer output short to a +5 V rail at +2% gives" (at 670.76 268.31 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d01a4c8b-7f01-5a8e-8167-9aafd5bb5a1c"))
	(text "about 2.55 V after division; the ESD diode does not limit DC faults." (at 670.76 270.85 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e019341b-c662-5fd4-9c9a-c7e725c21490"))
	(polyline (pts (xy 670.76 282.28) (xy 825.76 282.28)) (stroke (width 0.254) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "a7913a29-6a88-5727-97b2-35155a5221d2"))
	(text "PCB PLACEMENT / ROUTING" (at 670.76 284.82 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0aba4460-203f-5609-bc4c-c1ca5179e14e"))
	(text "Place sensor connector -> input filter / INA821 -> RC filter / buffer -> analog output along a quiet edge. Place the ADC toward the digital side." (at 670.76 288.97 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ac9d4d7f-a686-5063-9a3e-4db35e838688"))
	(text "Keep motor/brake copper and the 12 V switching loop remote. Return bridge excitation and shield at the connector; do not share their current paths" (at 670.76 292.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b753c491-897d-5080-866a-5cd4dfe12928"))
	(text "with input/filter returns." (at 670.76 295.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0fd3bf1e-aaa0-5593-ad62-747f4a0606a0"))
	(polyline (pts (xy 670.76 306.75) (xy 825.76 306.75)) (stroke (width 0.254) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "a9a58658-91fe-5fcc-b370-f63fc1e5aaa0"))
	(text "VERIFY" (at 670.76 309.29 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6a253c89-675e-5538-be00-6e5095f78ba2"))
	(text "As-drawn issues: no calibration gate pull-down or chip-select pull-up. ${d862c3c4-2a7f-415f-b388-be063b3ac416:REFERENCE} and ${63d682bb-4ee0-41e4-8149-d05cef0b7d7d:REFERENCE}/${d4083624-9fb2-4ef5-b419-e288f55c8635:REFERENCE}/${43d96ed1-ba05-41c0-a2f2-eb6ecd253143:REFERENCE} load or tap shared SPI lines;" (at 670.76 313.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2415b275-d4f4-5eef-ba1b-290363db9812"))
	(text "resolve board ownership before reuse." (at 670.76 315.98 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f507b30c-679f-506e-bd03-74e61051c903"))
	(text "Verify harness pinout against ${de5971d3-210a-427e-bcf2-1b0120408c65:REFERENCE} on this sheet. Historical pin tables and GPIO calibration claims do not match this circuit." (at 670.76 319.79 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8cd86836-16b8-5d71-8238-8e644ca213fb"))
	(text "Bench-check excitation-loop stability with the real cable, switcher pickup, calibration switching, polarity and output loading. Connectivity checks do" (at 670.76 323.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "db524a39-43a0-5bb8-990b-88ac6ea2de62"))
	(text "not establish analog performance." (at 670.76 326.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b01ebcdb-2746-526c-8ff4-8d0f81291955"))
	(text "Declare supply drive for +12V, +5V and +3.3V at the board/harness boundary for ERC; the ferrites and ${0cf28f10-9ac5-4f39-9f87-bff72c64332b:REFERENCE} interrupt driver propagation, so the" (at 670.76 329.95 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "86c84a03-0fb8-5540-b531-402714f40627"))
	(text "block flags +12V_FILT, +5V_FILT and VEXC itself. Put separate block instances on separate hierarchical sheets so their local nets do not merge." (at 670.76 332.49 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b7280c01-850f-54ed-83e1-42dc96f22f5e"))
	(polyline (pts (xy 670.76 343.92) (xy 825.76 343.92)) (stroke (width 0.254) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "663324e0-e777-5954-8609-35624beb366c"))
	(text "DESIGN NOTES" (at 670.76 346.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3dce6100-36d2-51f1-b57d-53bdf314ac33"))
	(text "Source migration preserves the existing circuit and routed PCB. Review the calibration-drive and SPI ownership limitations before reuse." (at 670.76 350.61 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b0a8b375-b145-53a0-bdcf-bc71e5a3eab0"))
	(text "Original connector notes: -SIG (WHITE); +SIG (GREEN); +EXC (RED); -EXC (BLACK); SHIELD. ${de5971d3-210a-427e-bcf2-1b0120408c65:REFERENCE} pin mapping is documented in section 1." (at 670.76 354.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b9e3f6b2-1e79-5ef4-afcc-c73f350ab864"))
	(polyline (pts (xy 670.76 365.85) (xy 825.76 365.85)) (stroke (width 0.254) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "17269531-0fcc-53a5-85e0-2c6663cf7a2b"))
	(text "DESIGN CONTRACT" (at 670.76 368.39 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bab03211-f76b-53f9-a609-5aff79446cc4"))
	(text "Single-channel torque sensor front end for a Transducer Techniques RTS-5 reaction bridge (350 ohm, 1.5 mV/V, 5 in-oz), giving a nominal" (at 670.76 372.54 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ca0eac93-b301-5faa-894e-4ad96e35e70e"))
	(text "0.3540-1.3127 V ground-referenced rated-range analog output for a Neuropixels OneBox ADC channel, plus an on-board ADS8689 that streams the" (at 670.76 375.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "274042dd-1495-52e7-bd91-7faba5b7fb3e"))
	(text "same conditioned signal at FULL amplitude. At the BNC, zero torque is nominally 0.8333 V; the fitted 259 ohm gain resistance gives INA821 gain" (at 670.76 377.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b8dc66ac-6ac7-5204-ae88-0bb861835b72"))
	(text "191.734. At 1.5 mV/V, +/-rated spans 0.3540-1.3127 V. The 1.577 mV/V sensor certificate at +/-150% overload predicts 0.0774-1.5892 V before" (at 670.76 380.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6a9a062c-31e2-58f7-bdf2-9641269fe294"))
	(text "tolerances. The ADC sees twice the unloaded BNC amplitude." (at 670.76 382.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ab565b8b-d5c0-55ee-a476-c36d8a4fba1c"))
	(text "FULL DERIVATION, VALUES, LAYOUT RULES AND OPEN ITEMS ARE IN kicad-libs docs/torque-sensor-interface-design.md. This note carries only what" (at 670.76 385.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7c6ecf2b-77ad-5bf4-8d51-2d0da333061e"))
	(text "breaks silently without it. Designators have changed across annotations, so the invariants below are also identified by NET." (at 670.76 387.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "86af5886-f4c5-5c40-b57e-db15d05d3ec0"))
	(text "1. EVERYTHING THAT LEAVES THE BOARD IS HALVED; THE ON-BOARD ADC IS NOT. A /2 divider (two 3.2k 0.1% 25ppm/C plus a 470 pF C0G midpoint" (at 670.76 390.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8b15ac04-2069-515b-9961-bab050b0d5d2"))
	(text "shunt) sits in the TQ_AOUT leg only, between AMP_VOUT and the 249 ohm BNC resistor. TQ_AOUT_MON taps the divider midpoint so the scope tap reads" (at 670.76 392.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cd9ad798-1f83-50e9-b27d-3600cb66e619"))
	(text "what the BNC delivers. ADC_IN taps AMP_VOUT, so the MCU record and the OneBox record differ by exactly 2 and need TWO calibration constants." (at 670.76 395.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "eff08a9c-3348-5a4f-99c5-a508ca98ca0c"))
	(text "AMP_VOUT is the single reference node for both." (at 670.76 397.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1fb89ac8-47c5-5a0d-a3b0-b43a641cf83f"))
	(text "2. THE ADC's TAP MUST NOT MOVE TO THE MIDPOINT, and this is not obvious. The ADS8689's AIN_P is a RESISTIVE input, 1 MOhm +/-15% and" (at 670.76 400.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cc3f0fa8-14a1-572f-94e7-27912cae789f"))
	(text "range-programmable between 1 MOhm and 1.2 MOhm -- not a buffered high-Z input. On the midpoint it parallels the 3.2k bottom leg and becomes" (at 670.76 403.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4019a034-009f-585a-a03a-3d6dd2ae822a"))
	(text "part of the ratio: BNC loading goes from -0.185% to -0.344%, the converter's input bias puts about +2.6 mV on the BNC (0.018 N.cm, ten times the" (at 670.76 405.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f84caecf-3d4c-56e3-8757-df37feffe00f"))
	(text "sensor's 0.0018 N.cm nonrepeatability), and a firmware write changing the ADC's input range silently re-scales the OneBox reading. The bound the" (at 670.76 408.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "15b3455a-b0a0-5d6c-b551-d3654e5c105d"))
	(text "divider exists for does not apply to ADC_IN anyway: it never leaves the board, the ADC's range is 0-5.12 V, and its input protection is +/-20 V" (at 670.76 410.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e1296508-8812-5872-96af-63a0fc47f25f"))
	(text "powered." (at 670.76 413.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "91bb9a5d-b95d-5da3-84ca-01d78e124637"))
	(text "3. THE INA821's +VS BINDS TO VEXC, NOT +12V_FILT. That limits the INA821-driven pre-divider ceiling to about 3.283 V, or 1.642 V after division. It" (at 670.76 415.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "21934431-2a44-5fae-b8be-9a89d69ca5d7"))
	(text "is NOT a universal output fault clamp: a downstream +5 V buffer rail fault at +2% can give about 2.55 V after division, and the ESD device does not" (at 670.76 418.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ef345ff7-59f4-5868-a363-229b74d7cd07"))
	(text "clamp DC. Check the receiving input limits independently. Both nets are 10-12 V, both 'work', and ERC passes either way." (at 670.76 420.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6263f8ff-9f08-5324-91d7-336426f7ee0f"))
	(text "4. THE EXCITATION LOOP FEEDS BACK FROM VEXC AT THE CONNECTOR PIN, not from the emitter or the base node. From the emitter the 10 ohm" (at 670.76 423.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ac6425a7-eb57-57e6-960a-c373b305474d"))
	(text "isolation resistor's 286 mV drop goes uncorrected, a 2.9% sensitivity error. The 100k pull-down on VREF10 is what makes an open reference fail LOW" (at 670.76 425.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9603b4eb-b302-5c7e-9daf-9a601f1e6ef1"))
	(text "instead of driving the ceiling to the 12 V rail." (at 670.76 428.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "594da0d1-6f85-5881-bd20-f8b291079b43"))
	(text "5. TQ_AOUT, TQ_AOUT_MON AND ADC_IN ARE THREE DIFFERENT NETS AT TWO DIFFERENT SCALES. TQ_AOUT is the delivered output and carries the 249 ohm" (at 670.76 430.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "68317672-cda9-5b86-bbf0-142944cd19bd"))
	(text "source resistor and the ESD clamp; verify on the netlist that the clamp shares a net with the connector pin. This was got wrong once already, on" (at 670.76 433.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "38c89c12-8f8a-503c-83f2-65bf0d00fc42"))
	(text "mouse-joystick-pcb." (at 670.76 436.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "375b91cf-48c4-5736-b369-deea6a95f6bf"))
	(text "6. TQ_AOUT HAS AN INA821-LIMITED CEILING OF ABOUT 1.642 V FROM A 1.849 kohm SOURCE AND NEEDS A >=1 Mohm LOAD. The source is the 249" (at 670.76 438.58 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0dad0b9a-8c33-540a-ab94-a05267e6e566"))
	(text "ohm series resistor PLUS the divider's 1.6 kohm, not 249 ohm alone -- against the OneBox AD7616-P's 1 Mohm that is -0.185% of gain, systematic" (at 670.76 441.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b378f5bc-e083-5f1e-91f4-b61655619c32"))
	(text "and absorbed by per-board calibration, but a 100 kohm load costs -1.82% and a 50 ohm terminated input reads a fraction of the correct value. The" (at 670.76 443.66 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a9b412ab-0553-5cf3-a5e7-46b21a6abf0b"))
	(text "249 ohm bounds a short of TQ_AOUT to ground at 6.6 mA and 11 mW inside a 62.5 mW 0402. The ESD clamp is a transient device and does NOT" (at 670.76 446.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c7b974f0-ec02-5e17-8625-3fc79846f780"))
	(text "bound a DC fault." (at 670.76 448.74 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8590f0eb-12f1-5a3b-a7a1-810521cc496b"))
	(text "7. THE RATIO RESISTORS ARE TWO SEPARATE MATCHED SETS AND THE BLOCK ALSO CONTAINS DECOYS. FIVE 10.0k ERA2AEB103X from one reel -- two" (at 670.76 451.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b5e784ad-43be-5e0a-b950-4f5b94b8f92e"))
	(text "for the /2 VMID midpoint, two in series for the /3 ADC divider top, one for its bottom. TWO 3.2k RT0402BRD073K2L from one reel for the output /2" (at 670.76 453.82 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "04032750-9d6b-5f78-a69a-7aab18e1c77d"))
	(text "divider. The block's two generic 10k pulls (${7c1353a3-36e5-4b6a-aab5-3df8722db5b4:REFERENCE} reset pull-up, ${d862c3c4-2a7f-415f-b388-be063b3ac416:REFERENCE} CIPO pull-down) are also 10k, and there are THREE 249 ohm parts --" (at 670.76 456.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "02d43a5b-8050-590f-86bb-9957e602b99a"))
	(text "the BNC series resistor, the ADC series resistor, and the 0.1% RG gain resistor. Identify every one of them by NET, never by value or by designator" (at 670.76 458.9 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2740d467-9638-5666-af63-5d2e22fd77bf"))
	(text "adjacency." (at 670.76 461.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bdcef27b-346e-5263-8924-20ac2770ebf5"))
	(text "8. THE FILTER CAPACITORS MUST BE C0G, AND SO MUST THE 470 pF DIVIDER MIDPOINT SHUNT. Retune the filter by scaling BOTH capacitors by the same" (at 670.76 463.98 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b8043e81-d9b6-53bc-a420-a318d445825a"))
	(text "factor; the resistors set the DC gain and the whole mapping. Its 263 us group delay is deliberately matched to analog_output_0_3v3_dac80501's 266" (at 670.76 466.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "39e77d29-e9ee-5296-8ba1-9244c9f99dc3"))
	(text "us. The midpoint shunt is 470 pF because it adds only 0.75 us against that budget; 10 nF would add 16 us. Class-2 dielectric is piezoelectric, this" (at 670.76 469.06 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "655f3f5f-d6f9-572d-a430-ed8ba1603377"))
	(text "board is coupled to a stepper and a hand-driven joystick, and on the divider midpoint that pickup becomes signal. A mechanically generated torque" (at 670.76 471.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5bf69314-193f-5026-b1a3-dfb530fdba06"))
	(text "artifact in a torque measurement cannot be filtered out." (at 670.76 474.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9fc289b3-7570-542e-aeb1-5863797eb6fa"))
	(text "9. SPI: the saved circuit has a 10k pull-down on CIPO (SDO) and no fitted pull-up on TQ_CONVST_CS. Shared-bus idle termination belongs to the" (at 670.76 476.68 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9bf78a3c-d38c-5a89-b38c-8ca4e3dd42e9"))
	(text "BOARD; repeated blocks duplicate the inherited CIPO pull and SCK/CIPO/COPI instrument taps. Resolve this ownership issue before reuse. The placing" (at 670.76 479.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9a1adef5-c34c-5fb8-b815-28e5f6feaf92"))
	(text "board defines SCK and COPI on the peripheral side of the default-open SN74CB3Q3245; the RP2040 end uses its own pad pull-downs." (at 670.76 481.76 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7abc6b97-58a9-5c12-a509-2a557498861f"))
	(text "10. SHUNT CALIBRATION IS NOT VERIFIED: TQ_CAL_EN drives the ${799e2d6a-2867-4a33-b918-63008ea07cdb:REFERENCE} gate directly, with no fitted gate pull-down; the only series part on that port" (at 670.76 484.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f0f3cca8-3748-543b-888d-c92a9afba658"))
	(text "is the 1k ${c033e40c-0431-4127-8ac2-73f467170639:REFERENCE} feeding the TQ_CAL_EN_INST tap. Its source is SIG_N, nominally near 5 V, so a 3.3 V GPIO cannot provide positive VGS. Arrange an" (at 670.76 486.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "de494671-9ad8-5859-85ae-94ca327541a4"))
	(text "appropriate drive and reset-safe gate bias in a separately reviewed circuit revision before relying on shunt calibration. It is a static enable, not an" (at 670.76 489.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "defca817-49da-5e0c-858c-4382834143d3"))
	(text "edge worth a logic-analyzer channel." (at 670.76 491.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bed45927-604f-56a1-9013-e32ea718b67e"))
	(text "11. PWR_FLAG on +12V_FILT, +5V_FILT and VEXC is required, because ferrites and a pass transistor break driver propagation. GND is flagged once at" (at 670.76 494.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e680fbbd-84a6-538a-a675-fd13b275cbad"))
	(text "board level, not here. Expect ERC to want one on the ADC's REFCAP and REFIO too: the official-derived symbol types REFCAP as power_in, matching" (at 670.76 497 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f40be8d3-77df-5b38-8db6-bf1ec8b3f0c2"))
	(text "upstream. Not a defect." (at 670.76 499.54 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d48d58ce-dcff-5de1-8327-619e3793c1df"))
	(text "12. Bind +12V, +5V and +3.3V all to the SWITCHED domain. 0 V and the INA821-limited 1.642 V ceiling are out-of-band fault indications; other" (at 670.76 502.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "94133688-7c12-5971-92be-c83d36c89294"))
	(text "faults can exceed that ceiling. Two instances need separate sheets or their local nets merge." (at 670.76 504.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "62726fe7-f23c-50e1-b1b7-20abeefc47c9"))
	(text "13. CALIBRATION IS PER SENSOR AND PER BOARD, and the two channels are NOT interchangeable -- pair each sensor with a board serial and move" (at 670.76 507.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d549c2ad-335e-5ec2-a85f-b5a5a3f5c8a2"))
	(text "its certificate constant with it. Fit the BNC and the ADC paths separately; do not derive one from the other by a factor of 2, because the divider's own" (at 670.76 509.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4acfedae-e3c4-545a-908b-6420544c86ce"))
	(text "0.1% tolerance is part of the BNC gain. The sensor is the limit either way: 0.05% nonrepeatability is 0.001765 N.cm, which is 249 uV at the BNC after" (at 670.76 512.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "19ff3a2c-973c-5197-b64b-72a9c81ae9f5"))
	(text "the divider (1.6 OneBox codes) and 6.4 LSB at the ADC's 78.125 uV." (at 670.76 514.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e1ddc4a2-5b87-5e26-8ef1-9805d6e2bbbe"))
	(group "Review page 01: 1. Sensor connector and calibration review" (uuid "80037c16-5c0c-5eba-b33b-06feeb2cbb1d") (members "3a58622c-27c8-4a60-8f9f-184e1290b2b4" "04912498-79e0-5b48-ba18-5eaaf0ed1d02" "cd2bf5f3-8724-5b0d-9cd5-433390c4dc27" "07d3c0e0-2031-551a-aa24-90bfbf44042f" "dc1f6d7f-d5cd-5917-b0cf-0e35e076fa50" "de5971d3-210a-427e-bcf2-1b0120408c65" "9b020da4-f9de-5e81-a0fa-98de3fb701fd" "4cc511a4-db78-5e27-aa77-1b6f97ce167d" "d031b25a-2d93-5e69-b207-22da4846f058" "95fe3ba0-40a8-5c0c-96a0-2b4238ab1735" "82b4a9c2-8636-5a84-8523-b24d97cd07fa" "f2c92150-8173-5fbe-a434-866cd0dbb6e6" "19ad9f0d-5207-5cdb-aa76-af40806f5a1c" "6c59c7b8-ccb9-54d4-91a3-afe0da8ac224" "6f83efc5-6302-5b01-9885-e4c339c66b04" "7c77ce58-b3c1-5bbc-a3f0-22bdd5d31b33" "799e2d6a-2867-4a33-b918-63008ea07cdb" "7f63d467-0202-5189-977a-6cdb3c7e0fc1" "429d5058-facc-542f-abdc-1b0920073597" "5550695d-d01d-54c5-841b-66bc481a044d" "f37f4ef5-96ba-514a-a120-0ba2baf85a07" "76a283eb-ae7f-5a07-b675-e9a8cf51e676" "8803bdc7-61fe-57f5-9fd6-79e51a0fb329" "80f29761-f104-4294-a3b6-6bdaf34c95b7" "16d72774-0d4c-59df-92cc-8ba5adb34d7a" "f6da129f-e0ee-5d45-8841-9e5f97d659b7" "0400a6bc-721f-5055-bd6f-2bdb25710860" "e137d449-9870-5757-935c-0601d3ba86bf" "c033e40c-0431-4127-8ac2-73f467170639" "118de8c1-417b-57fe-af6c-8a88a2665009" "5c77779d-bdee-5dc1-8b68-e81eef4c08a8" "d42806f5-2e7d-5b60-b3bb-48e33f9af6da" "e7df1b93-bb4d-500e-9e40-a5cba1afa49b" "40e56e35-9be9-4a08-b34c-74e61a20dedd" "27a6e0ff-ae47-5a4d-b7f1-b71ad12c1546" "94ad74f5-18c1-57a3-8178-e5e6efba1ee8" "36483af6-2947-564c-85a7-92e1c13e01a4" "b548c98d-b550-5376-a4a5-25d3794fcca8" "86af9c54-2ea2-57ff-9f9a-ff825cb07291" "0d3e4fc3-25fb-5334-91e3-5b8a33983d9d" "8d1012ae-8410-51d2-876f-20ae7ef6d007" "6cfb4b55-f759-55ab-94a9-97d77efac7f7" "d58ae4db-ba26-51c2-b539-852cecb6f35a" "d4dc1b2f-99b5-5931-8b3f-e47ff2c4b01e" "bd277aff-1081-513a-8677-a481c4a96e08" "2b45ac15-516f-5a2e-8601-b605501f2286" "0b32aa66-9ad1-5251-8fc6-8573b6ee3062" "38a958f7-e8ff-59af-a20e-0349d43c9b1a" "ae9